## Project Objectives

Development of a commercial-scale direct air capture (DAC) facility to remove CO2 from the atmosphere, with permanent geological sequestration and carbon credit monetization.

### Key Deliverables
1. 50,000 tonne/year DAC facility
2. CO2 compression and transport system
3. Geological sequestration infrastructure
4. Carbon credit certification
5. Monitoring and verification system

